Subject: Inf or NaN in BYM when zero_mean = 1
Message-ID: <j-WCMvdaF1E.fOri5wmpAQAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/j-WCMvdaF1E/m/fOri5wmpAQAJ>
