Rob, without seeing your full code it's impossible to say for sure.  But my suspicion is that elsewhere in your model code (not shown in your email) is another usage of the "s" variable, but with the wrong number of dimensions, perhaps something like:
s[i, 1], or
s[ XX, YY]   ## where XX and YY can be absolutely anything

either of these would be telling nimble that "s" is now 2-dimensional, which is inconsistent with the 1-dimensional CAR process specification.  That said, without seeing your full model code (and a reproducible example of the error), it's impossible to say for sure.

Let us know if this helps,
Daniel

